4:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Why placement changes the threshold"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"\"Frequency above 5\" is not a single universal ceiling - it moves with where the ad shows up. Feed placements accumulate frequency slowly, since each impression competes with organic content for attention, so fatigue tends to show later. Stories and Reels placements are consumed faster and repeat sooner in a single session, so the same numeric frequency represents more real exposure to the same eyes."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Feed:"}]," CTR erosion usually starts to show past a frequency of 6-7."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Stories/Reels:"}]," The same erosion often shows up by a frequency of 3-4, because the format is skippable in under a second."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Retargeting audiences:"}]," Frequency climbs fastest here because the pool is small - check this segment separately from cold prospecting."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Break your frequency report out by placement before deciding the ad is fatigued. A blended frequency of 4 can hide a Stories segment already past its real ceiling."}]]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"When the page is the problem"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"But here's the pattern most miss: frequency high, clicks still strong, but conversions flat or falling. People are clicking - the page is where to investigate next."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Frequency >5 but CTR stable: The ad still works, audience isn't fatigued"]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Clicks consistent but conversions dropping: The page fails to convert interest"]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"High bounce rate on landing page: The message-ad mismatch kills momentum"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"This pattern suggests the page - not the ad - is worth investigating as the friction point."}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Why the page fails first at high frequency"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A visitor who has seen the same ad four or five times has already formed an expectation before they click. Two page-side failures show up specifically at high frequency, even when they were invisible at low frequency:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Static page, rotating creative."}]," If you refresh ad hooks to fight fatigue but the landing page headline never changes, repeat viewers land on a page that no longer matches the specific angle that got them to click this time."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"No new information on repeat visits."}]," A visitor on their fourth impression has already read the page once. If nothing on it answers a harder, more skeptical question than the first visit did, there is no reason for this exposure to convert where the last three didn't."]}]]}]]}]]}]
7:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Test: change the page not the ad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Before you pause a high-performing ad or overhaul your targeting, run this test:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Keep the ad running as-is if CTR is above benchmark"]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Build a new landing page variant that matches the ad hook precisely"]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Send 50% of traffic to the new page"]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"Measure conversions, not just clicks"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If the new page converts at a higher rate while frequency remains stable, you've found the leak. The audience was never tired - the page just wasn't closing."}]]}]
